@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. AUTHENTICATION

# Login Admin
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ShintaNursobah",
  "password": "ShintaLucu12"
}

### Check Current Logged-in Admin Profile (/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Logout (Client-side stateless handling)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/logout


### 2. PROFILE

# Get Profile (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile

### Update Profile (Protected - Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

