### 3. PROJECTS (Galeri Karya)

# Get All Projects (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### Get Projects Filtered by Category (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?category=Website Development

### Get Project By UUID (Public)
# Ganti UUID dengan UUID yang valid
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/a616872b-56da-487e-8742-d35eed110681

### Create Project (Protected - Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Aplikasi VocabMaster",
  "category": "Website Development",
  "description": "Membuat aplikasi belajar bahasa inggris lengkap dengan backend ExpressJS dan database PostgreSQL Supabase.",
  "imageUrl": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcRYBUM6kg04UW80B4kCY4_ywUEJw9PD4igEBEHHsWnsYw&s=10.jpg",
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Shinta505/VocabMaster"
}

### Update Project (Protected - Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/a616872b-56da-487e-8742-d35eed110681
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Aplikasi VocabMaster Update",
  "category": "Website Development",
  "description": "Membuat aplikasi belajar bahasa inggris lengkap dengan JavaScript dan ExpressJS",
  "imageUrl": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcS51Wl9PwAeHcOB5XjjVmaBVFJ2SWEAKmYBiXIdOxkb_g&s=10.jpg",
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Shinta505/VocabMaster"
}

### Delete Project (Protected - Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/a616872b-56da-487e-8742-d35eed110681
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 4. ARTICLES (Blog)

# Get All Articles (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles

### Get Article By ID / UUID (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/8134ac5f-fd63-4f36-b981-c9140143543c

### Get Article By Slug (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/slug/belajar-sequelize-dan-supabase

### Create Article (Protected - Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Belajar Sequelize dan Supabase",
  "content": "Ini adalah isi konten artikel lengkap seputar pengembangan web menggunakan Sequelize dan database PostgreSQL di Supabase.",
  "image": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTxV4EaRAfd7q6YnsVl2200EU_IWyL1lSqiM1-SPlXPZA&s.jpg",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Update Article (Protected - Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/articles/8134ac5f-fd63-4f36-b981-c9140143543c
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Belajar Sequelize dan Supabase Update",
  "content": "Konten artikel yang telah diperbarui secara berkala.",
  "image": "https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT-joWSyCfvx0fbILZcasyI09tPLQ4qPhg3wGL5VkXDiw&s=10.jpg",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-05T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Delete Article (Protected - Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/articles/8134ac5f-fd63-4f36-b981-c9140143543c
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


### 5. CONTACT (Pesan Masuk)

# Send Message / Form Contact (Public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com",
  "subject": "Kerjasama Proyek",
  "message": "Halo, saya tertarik untuk mendiskusikan pembuatan website bersama Anda."
}

### Get All Messages (Protected - Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Delete Message by ID (Protected - Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contact/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}